				"name": "recordedCapture.binding",
				"type": "CaptureBinding",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The requested capture: its side, record id, scenario, state, evidence id, viewport and SHA-256 hash, each of which must match what the evidence lists. A capture with no viewport matches only a viewport of null, and nothing else in the request, such as a path or address, is read.",
